---
name: phase-3-outline
description: The outline phase sub-workflow of the plan unit.
type: subworkflow
icon: phase.outline
entry: start
entry: light
entry: rework
exit: done
exit: returned
modification_date: 2026-01-15
version: 0.1.0
author: plan-marshall
---
# The outline phase as its own unit, written for the invariant and unit-loader tests, never copied from the product.
# The deep lane passes outline.qgate before outline.gate; the light lane passes outline.light-regate, whose deep
# outcome is the light -> deep ratchet; only outline.gate enters Phase 4, through the `done` exit. Each lane routes
# its rework to its own authoring entry, no router reads the lane: the deep Q-Gate remediation re-enters outline.deep,
# a failed check of the light outline re-enters outline.light-regate, so the deep route reaches no state of the light
# route. Every rework cycle passes a job, its awaited event. The plan unit re-enters the phase through `entry rework`.
workflow phase-3-outline version 1 format 1
scope subworkflow
entry start -> outline.deep
entry light -> outline.light
entry rework -> outline.rework-entry

state outline.deep
    job llm change role outline
        approved -> outline.qgate
        lost -> outline.return-exit

state outline.qgate
    auto test.qgate
        pass -> outline.gate
        blocking -> outline.remediate

state outline.remediate
    call remediation.qgate-findings(retry_budget = 2, fix_budget = 2, waiver_wait_seconds = 3600, actions = [retry, fix])
        resolved -> outline.gate
        waived -> outline.gate
        exhausted -> outline.return-exit
        fix_requested -> outline.deep
        stepped_out -> outline.return-exit

state outline.light
    auto test.proceed
        done -> outline.light-regate

state outline.light-regate
    auto test.gate
        pass -> outline.light-review
        deep -> outline.deep

state outline.light-review
    job test.build
        succeeded -> outline.gate
        failed -> outline.light-regate
        cancelled -> outline.return-exit

state outline.gate
    auto test.proceed
        done -> outline.done-exit

state outline.rework-entry
    auto test.proceed
        done -> outline.deep

state outline.done-exit terminal done success

state outline.return-exit terminal returned failure
